        "status": "implemented",
        "title": "Route user input",
        "description": "Decides whether user input is a message or an interface command; for a command, finds the action and the element and analyses feasibility, cost and what needs confirmation. Method is a setting (intent_routing_method): heuristic (local and free: explicit command syntax and a phrase lexicon from data, no model call), model (one use_model call with the configured model, guarded like any other) or off. Data: runtime/intent_routing.pack; the phrases of an action are on the action (`phrases`).",
